<title>
Accessory Socket Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9806021001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove floor console side cover and floor console box in the assembled state. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9806020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect accessory socket connector (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Release lock (5) by pushing it outward with small flat-bladed screwdriver or the like.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Push out accessory socket body (3) from backside.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Release lock by pushing claws (6) inward and push out accessory socket cap (4).
</ptxt>
